{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-03-coastal-week-ahead/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:35:54.317Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"185903eee2dfc5a36a8e1ce748ab0b3148cb34f0a6ecaf3d0b2203c0f1b5ecf3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina Kroll: I've set up the Monday digest. Each Monday it reads #coastal-team and #coastal-random, then posts a 'Coastal week ahead' summary here. The summary covers the previous week and any open customer items. Finance figures are left out.\n\nIt isn't fully reliable yet, for three reasons:\n- The scheduler's own clock is already at Oct 24, so its first run shows as Mon Oct 26 at 08:00 Chicago time. It may skip Mon Oct 19. I can post a first digest by hand on the 19th if you want one.\n- The scheduler gateway isn't running, so the job is saved but won't fire until someone starts it.\n- I set the job to 13:00 UTC, which is 08:00 CDT. Clocks go back on Nov 1, so from then it would fire at 07:00 Chicago time unless I change it to 14:00 UTC.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-03-coastal-week-ahead/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:35:58.280Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4aa72af60ec2b390c07176a3ea4702448883999337a2c498d19ba95c58a31bdd","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, I've scheduled the Monday digest, but it won't run until someone starts the scheduler. I posted this in your thread.\n\n- **What it does:** Each Monday it reads #coastal-team and #coastal-random. It posts a \"Coastal week ahead\" summary in #coastal-team covering the previous week and any open customer items. It leaves out finance figures.\n- **Schedule:** I set it for 13:00 UTC, which is 08:00 Chicago time (CDT).\n- **Gateway not running:** The Hermes gateway isn't running, so the job is saved but won't fire until someone runs `hermes gateway start`.\n- **First run may miss Oct 19:** The scheduler's clock is already at Oct 24, so it shows the first run as Mon Oct 26. I can post the Oct 19 digest by hand if you want.\n- **Clock change on Nov 1:** The job is pinned to UTC, so after the clocks go back it would fire at 07:00 Chicago time. It needs changing to 14:00 UTC then."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
